  "description_short": "Family-run pizzeria in George serving authentic wood-fired pizzas and Italian classics in a relaxed, welcoming atmosphere.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away in Blanco, Pollock's Pizza Cafe has been a George favourite for locals and visitors seeking proper wood-fired pizza without the fuss. The atmosphere is warm and unpretentious – think checked tablecloths, the aroma of fresh dough, and families settling in for a proper meal.\n\nThe pizzas are the main draw here, with thin, crispy bases loaded with quality toppings that won't break the bank. Beyond pizza, you'll find Italian comfort food done well – pastas, salads, and a few hearty mains. It's the kind of place where you can bring the kids, catch up with mates over a beer, or simply grab a quick bite that feels homemade.\n\nLocated on Montagu Street, it's easy to find and easier to enjoy. The service is friendly, portions are generous, and you'll leave satisfied without the fine-dining price tag. A solid neighbourhood spot that does what it does well.",
